        "id": "batch/lanterns",
        "note": "The light, placed with the rooms. The hall is hung with thirteen soul lanterns from its ceiling (y +3 from the walk plane, ceiling at +4), two staggered rows at x -2 and x +2 four blocks apart, which leaves its darkest walkable cells, along the walls between lanterns, at light 3: dim and blue. The antechamber and the alcove each hang one ordinary lantern at their centre, warm and brighter, so the hall reads as the dark between them."
      },
